    {
      "id": "exam/edexcel-8fm0-01-2024-june/q1",
      "question": "<p>The cubic equation</p><div class=\"equation\" data-math=\"2x^3 - 3x^2 + 5x + 7 = 0\" data-display=\"true\"></div><p>has roots <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\alpha, \\beta\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\gamma\"></span>.</p><p>Without solving the equation, determine the exact value of</p><p>(i) <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\alpha^2 + \\beta^2 + \\gamma^2\"></span></p><p><span class=\"marks\">(3)</span></p><p>(ii) <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\frac{3}{\\alpha} + \\frac{3}{\\beta} + \\frac{3}{\\gamma}\"></span></p><p><span class=\"marks\">(3)</span></p><p>(iii) <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(5 - \\alpha)(5 - \\beta)(5 - \\gamma)\"></span></p><p><span class=\"marks\">(3)</span></p>",
