    {
      "id": "exam/edexcel-8fm0-01-2024-june/q6",
      "question": "<p>The drainage system for a sports field consists of underground pipes.</p><p>This situation is modelled with respect to a fixed origin <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"O\"></span>.</p><p>According to the model,</p><ul><li>the surface of the sports field is a plane with equation <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"z = 0\"></span></li></ul><ul><li>the pipes are straight lines</li></ul><ul><li>one of the pipes, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"P_1\"></span>, passes through the points <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"A(3, 4, -2)\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"B(-2, -8, -3)\"></span></li></ul><ul><li>a different pipe, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"P_2\"></span>, has equation <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\frac{x-1}{2} = \\frac{y-3}{4} = \\frac{z+1}{-2}\"></span></li></ul><ul><li>the units are metres</li></ul><p>(a) Determine a vector equation of the line representing the pipe <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"P_1\"></span></p><p><span class=\"marks\">(2)</span></p><p>(b) Determine the coordinates of the point at which the pipe <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"P_1\"></span> meets the surface of the playing field, according to the model.</p><p><span class=\"marks\">(2)</span></p><p>Determine, according to the model,</p><p>(c) the acute angle between pipes <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"P_1\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"P_2\"></span>, giving your answer in degrees to 3 significant figures,</p><p><span class=\"marks\">(3)</span></p><p>(d) the shortest distance between pipes <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"P_1\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"P_2\"></span></p><p><span class=\"marks\">(5)</span></p>",
      "steps": [
