      "id": "exam/edexcel-8fm0-01-2024-june/q7",
      "question": "<p>(i) Prove by induction that, for all positive integers <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n\"></span>,</p><div class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\sum_{r=1}^{n} \\frac{1}{r(r+1)} = \\frac{n}{n+1}\" data-display=\"true\"></div><p><span class=\"marks\">(5)</span></p><p>(ii) Prove by induction that, for all positive integers <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n\"></span>,</p><div class=\"equation\" data-math=\"f(n) = 3^{2n+4} - 2^{2n}\" data-display=\"true\"></div><p>is divisible by 5</p><p><span class=\"marks\">(5)</span></p>",
      "steps": [
